WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:03.943
Thank you to Shortform for sponsoring this
video.

00:00:03.943 --> 00:00:09.420
To get a free trial and an additional 25%
discount on the annual subscription which

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:17.249
includes unlimited access to their browser
